@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Editor" as Editor
participant "System" as System

activate Editor

    Editor -> System : Request to create a new map
    activate System

    System --> Editor : Prompt for map name
    deactivate System

    Editor -> System : Submit **valid** map name
    activate System

    System --> Editor: Provides size list
    deactivate System

    Editor -> System: Chose "Custom size"
    activate System

    System --> Editor: Requires size input
    deactivate System

    Editor -> System: Submit **invalid** size option
    activate System

    System --> Editor: Display success message:\n"ERROR: Invalid size of map. Must be integers.\nMap size must be under 256x256."

    deactivate System
    deactivate Editor

@enduml

